msgstr "Seguem o site"

#: inc/class-tainacan-interface-blocksy-map.php:1463
#: inc/class-tainacan-interface-blocksy-map.php:1487
msgid "Menus"
msgstr "Menus"

#: inc/class-tainacan-interface-blocksy-map.php:1463
msgid ""
"The menus themselves are content of the site and stay as they are; only the "
"place where each one appears is chosen again."
msgstr ""
"Os menus em si são conteúdo do site e ficam como estão; só o lugar onde cada"
" um aparece é escolhido de novo."

#: inc/class-tainacan-interface-blocksy-map.php:1468
msgid "Main menu"
msgstr "Menu principal"

#: inc/class-tainacan-interface-blocksy-map.php:1480
msgid ""
"The menu is in the other site. Export it with Tools > Export (Navigation "
"Menu Items) and choose it in Appearance > Menus."
msgstr ""
"O menu está no outro site. Exporte-o em Ferramentas > Exportar (Itens do "
"menu de navegação) e escolha-o em Aparência > Menus."

#: inc/class-tainacan-interface-blocksy-map.php:1484
msgid "Secondary menu of the header"
msgstr "Menu secundário do cabeçalho"

#: inc/class-tainacan-interface-blocksy-map.php:1484
msgid "This theme has one menu in the header."
msgstr "Este tema tem um menu no cabeçalho."

#: inc/class-tainacan-interface-blocksy-map.php:1487
msgid "No menu in a location"
msgstr "Nenhum menu numa posição"

#: inc/class-tainacan-interface-blocksy-map.php:1498
#: inc/class-tainacan-interface-blocksy-map.php:1534
msgid "Widgets"
msgstr "Widgets"

#: inc/class-tainacan-interface-blocksy-map.php:1498
msgid ""
"The blog sidebar of Blocksy goes to the sidebar of this theme, and its "
"footer areas to the footer area, in order."
msgstr ""
"A barra lateral do blog do Blocksy vai para a barra lateral deste tema, e as"
" áreas de rodapé dele para a área de rodapé, em ordem."

#: inc/class-tainacan-interface-blocksy-map.php:1518
msgid ""
"An area this theme does not have; the widgets stay among the inactive ones."
msgstr "Uma área que este tema não tem; os widgets ficam entre os inativos."

#: inc/class-tainacan-interface-blocksy-map.php:1534
msgid "None in the file"
msgstr "Nenhum no arquivo"

#: inc/class-tainacan-interface-blocksy-map.php:1534
msgid ""
"To bring widgets from another site, export from Blocksy with \"Widgets "
"settings\" checked."
msgstr ""
"Para trazer widgets de outro site, exporte do Blocksy com \"Configurações de"
" widgets\" marcado."

#: inc/class-tainacan-interface-blocksy-map.php:1545
#: inc/class-tainacan-interface-blocksy-map.php:1547
#: inc/class-tainacan-interface-blocksy-map.php:1555
