msgstr "%1$s kB, %2$d regras"

#: inc/class-tainacan-interface-blocksy-map.php:1558
msgid "Copied, after the CSS of this theme"
msgstr "Copiado, depois do CSS deste tema"

#: inc/class-tainacan-interface-blocksy-map.php:1569
msgid "Image in the Additional CSS"
msgstr "Imagem no CSS adicional"

#: inc/class-tainacan-interface-blocksy-map.php:1580
msgid "Palette colors in the content"
msgstr "Cores da paleta no conteúdo"

#: inc/class-tainacan-interface-blocksy-map.php:1580
msgid ""
"Blocks of pages and posts painted with the palette of Blocksy (classes has-"
"palette-color-N and the variables --theme-palette-color-N) lose their color "
"in another theme. The import keeps those colors in this theme, with the same"
" names, and offers them in the block editor."
msgstr ""
"Blocos de páginas e posts pintados com a paleta do Blocksy (classes has-"
"palette-color-N e as variáveis --theme-palette-color-N) perdem a cor em "
"outro tema. A importação mantém essas cores neste tema, com os mesmos nomes,"
" e as oferece no editor de blocos."

#: inc/class-tainacan-interface-blocksy-map.php:1584
msgid "Palette"
msgstr "Paleta"

#: inc/class-tainacan-interface-blocksy-map.php:1584
msgid "Same colors, same names"
msgstr "Mesmas cores, mesmos nomes"

#: inc/class-tainacan-interface-blocksy-map.php:1592
msgid "Shop (WooCommerce)"
msgstr "Loja (WooCommerce)"

#: inc/class-tainacan-interface-blocksy-map.php:1593
msgid "Tainacan, details without an equivalent"
msgstr "Tainacan, detalhes sem equivalente"

#: inc/class-tainacan-interface-blocksy-map.php:1594
msgid "Posts and pages, details"
msgstr "Posts e páginas, detalhes"

#: inc/class-tainacan-interface-blocksy-map.php:1595
msgid "Other settings"
msgstr "Outros ajustes"

#: inc/class-tainacan-interface-blocksy-link-control.php:32
