msgid "%s: HTML outside a block (it becomes a Classic block in the editor)."
msgstr "%s: HTML fora de bloco (vira um bloco Clássico no editor)."

#. translators: 1: where the markup is; 2: name of a block.
#: inc/ai-kit.php:570
